TITLE=E2E-85: Time-ordered DynamoDB review listing (#335)
TAGS=rollup,storage
MODE=dynamo
BODY=Seed reviews whose createdAt order disagrees with PR-number order, then confirm /dashboard/reviews lists by createdAt via the ByRepoCreatedAt GSI, date-filtered analytics totals count all matching rows, limit + v2 cursors paginate loss-free across repos, and a GSI-absent stack degrades to the legacy path with a single warning. Seeding + dashboard/API inspection, no fixture PR.
